{"id": "docs/index.html:html-7", "file": "docs/index.html", "location": "html-7", "text": "Only the app goes dark. Edge pairs with your band over Bluetooth, decodes what it\n        recorded, and works out your sleep, recovery, strain and the rest —\n        entirely on your phone. No account, no subscription, and no server that ever\n        receives your health data.", "sha256": "34990a9aa1259380a907ab9867d28c5cf56e15a34cc06283af309ad0af1d2505", "line": 45}
